=== Custom progress bar ===

Tags: prgressbar, wordpress progressbar, awesome progressbar,  multicolor progress bar, animated progressbar, bootstrap progressbar
Requires at least: 3.0.1
Tested up to: 3.4
Stable tag: 4.3
License: GPLv2 or later
